WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions
Language: en

00:00.000 --> 00:04.420
The unknown. Extreme wide, in black and white: a misty mountain valley with a stream, and a thin line of light far in the distance.

00:04.420 --> 00:09.710
The presence. Low angle between sheer rock walls: a tall column of light rises from wet ground.

00:09.710 --> 00:15.080
Through the trees. A dark forest of tall trunks; moving through it, the light appears between them.

00:15.080 --> 00:20.580
Architecture. Through the pines, a monumental building stands across still water, the light at its centre.

00:20.580 --> 00:22.500
Material. Extreme close-up: the camera slides across textured concrete to a lit edge.

00:22.500 --> 00:30.130
The studio. A concrete interior with a glass wall and a curved wall lit from below; the column of light stands in the room, reflected in the floor.

00:30.130 --> 00:35.290
The hall. A long hall of concrete columns, the light at its far end.

00:35.290 --> 00:40.670
Ascent. Looking up: the column of light rises through cone-shaped concrete forms.

00:40.670 --> 00:45.170
The geometry. From above, the camera descends over angular walls, steps and small lights, the line of light among them.

00:45.170 --> 00:49.380
Transformation. In mist, the column of light splits into sharp facets.

00:49.380 --> 00:55.170
The form. Thin lines of light cross the dark and come together as the W monogram, in white.

00:55.170 --> 01:00.320
The signature. The monogram turns gold; the WeAmaze Visionary wordmark appears, then the line Creative Intelligence. Made Real.
